From 08105333aed92bc64ace8164156fca0a41155b00 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 02:06:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add software FP8 Quick Reduce conversion

- Use ROCm E4M3-FNUZ software conversion on
  targets without FP8 conversion instructions.
- Keep native packed conversion builtins on GPUs
  that provide the required hardware feature.
- Add deterministic conversion and distributed
  correctness validators with run instructions.
- Validated boundary and all-byte decoding tests
  on gfx1100; compiled the gfx942 hardware path.
- Built module_quick_all_reduce for gfx1100.

Tools used:
- GPT-5.6 Sol: gpt-5.6-sol-high

Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
